hreshold unpredictable.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(comp (ref \\\"R1\\\") (value \\\"0.47ohm\\\") (footprint \\\"Resistor_SMD:R_0805_2012Metric_Pad1.20x1.40mm_HandSolder\\\")\"},\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(field (name \\\"Tolerance\\\") \\\"20%\\\")\"},\n        {\"source\": \"spec\", \"quote\": \"R1 | 0.47 \u03a9 current-sense resistor | EPD booster current-limit sense\"}\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The EPD boost current-limit threshold can vary by roughly \u00b120% from unit to unit, which can cause over- or under-current behaviour in the display driver.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.4\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"wrong_value\",\n      \"components\": [\"V_BAT_\"],\n      \"pins\": [\"BAT+\"],\n      \"nets\": [\"BAT+\"],\n      \"observed\": \"The SPICE deck drives the battery node BAT+ with a 25.0 V DC source. The schematic power section shows an 18650 single Li-ion cell (BAT+ feeds the FAN53610 VIN/EN pins).\",\n      \"expected\": \"A single 18650 Li-ion cell supplies roughly 3.0\u20134.2 V on BAT+, well within the FAN53610 input range (VIN max 5.5 V).\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"source\": \"spice\", \"quote\": \"V_BAT_ BAT+ 0 DC 25.0\"},\n        {\"source\": \"spec\", \"quote\": \"Single-cell Li-ion battery holder\"},\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(node (ref \\\"IC1\\\") (pin \\\"A2\\\") (pinfunction \\\"VIN\\\") (pintype \\\"passive\\\"))\"}\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"If this stimulus reflects the intended supply, a 25 V input would exceed the regulator's rated VIN and the 5.5 V-class parts on BAT+. Simulation results on the regulator and input capacitors would also be meaningless.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The netlist connectivity matches the specification in most places, but C11 is a capacitor on an inductor land pattern with one pad floating, R1 is a current-sense resistor specified at 20% tolerance, and the SP